# Changelog

## 2.0.0

- Update the sample as an AFB Binding V4 reference implementation.
- Add equivalent C and C++ implementations selectable at build time.
- Reorganize the documentation and add links to the official redpesk documentation.
- Rework RPM packaging with build conditionals for C/C++ selection and coverage.
- Rework redtest integration and coverage collection for local and packaged execution.

## 1.1.0

- Migrate to `manifest.yml`.
